# UI (shadcn + legacy)

## Prefer shadcn for new / account / dialogs

- Import from `@/components/ui/*` (`Button`, `Dialog`, `Input`, `Label`, …).
- Theme tokens: `src/styles/shadcn.css` (default shadcn light/dark). Toggle dark via `html.dark` (see `applyThemeClass` in `App.jsx`).
- Map legacy buttons: `action-btn primary` → `<Button>`; outline/secondary for secondary; `danger` → `variant="destructive"`.
- Docs: `docs/DESIGN-UI.md`.

## Keep legacy for schedule chrome

- Do **not** refactor `MonthSheet`, `SheetToolbar`, week Handsontable chrome to shadcn unless the user asks.
- Those areas use `src/index.css` (`.tb-btn`, `.action-btn`, sheet tokens).

## Forbidden

- New UI kits (MUI, Ant, Chakra, etc.).
- Inventing a new color/font system; do not replace Be Vietnam Pro globally.
- Random marketing gradients / “AI landing page” layouts for in-app screens.

## Adding components

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add <name>
```
